{"fw":"hozu","step":6,"tools":2,"commit":"cba84ca","attempts":1,"timedOut":false,"accept":{"passed":32,"total":32,"new":{"passed":3,"total":3},"regression":{"passed":29,"total":29},"failures":[]},"introduced":[],"introducedBase":"05","silentReview":false,"silentHint":false,"admitsProblem":false,"final":"**開啟 JavaScript（`hozu browse`）**：新增、點 `#work`、編輯、點 `All notes`、搜尋都正確，網址也有跟著變，沒有錯誤訊息。\n- **正式伺服器（`PORT=4801 npm start`）**：新增、篩選、錯誤標籤被擋這三種情況都用實際的 HTTP 請求確認過。\n\n## 過程中遇到的框架問題\n- **做法**：一開始篩選結果直接用網址上的 `tag` 來決定顯示內容。\n- **結果**：開啟 JavaScript 時，點標籤或 `All notes` 後舊內容不會被清掉，畫面上出現兩份清單。\n- **根因**：在同一頁只改 `?tag` 時，框架的頁面更新沒有完整換掉依賴網址參數的內容。\n- **解法**：篩選值改成放在 machine 的狀態裡，首次載入從網址讀進來，點連結時再同步更新。網址照樣會變，關閉 JavaScript 時仍是一般連結。\n\n## 下一步建議\n1. **決定是否提交**：改動還沒 commit，確認後可以一起提交，含 `hozu.lock.json`。\n2. **回報框架問題**：「同一頁只改網址參數時舊內容沒清掉」值得回報給 Hozu，之後其他用網址篩選的頁面也可能遇到。\n3. **補一次人工確認**：實測都是用框架工具和 curl 做的，建議在真的瀏覽器裡點一次標籤、`All notes` 和瀏覽器的上一頁。","cost":{"weighted":407021,"calls":41,"output":21536,"fresh":65273,"cached":2340681,"turnsBy":{"edit":13,"scaffold":0,"check":3,"verify":11,"serve":2,"docs":5,"spec":1,"read":5,"list":0,"other":0,"final":1},"carriedBy":{"edit":48483,"scaffold":0,"check":4692,"verify":21700,"serve":991,"docs":62706,"spec":29116,"read":33986,"list":0,"other":0,"start":109115},"fixes":1,"verifyOrServe":13,"toolsBy":{"edit":13,"scaffold":0,"check":3,"verify":11,"serve":2,"docs":6,"spec":1,"read":5,"list":0,"other":0}},"size":{"lines":775,"added":136,"removed":40},"duplication":{"lines":536,"duplicatedLines":10,"ratio":0.0187,"blocks":1},"js":{"login":23353,"list":23353},"hozu":{"checkOk":true,"typesOk":true,"errors":0,"warnings":0,"codes":[],"deadStates":0,"contracts":{"covered":2,"total":2},"lockEntries":31,"lockChanged":5,"states":8,"transitions":31,"diagnosticsSeen":{"HZ018":2,"HZ008":1,"HZ014":1,"HZ048":1},"hz018":{"count":2,"blocking":2,"warnings":0,"identical":2,"distinct":2,"runs":1},"hz057":{"count":0,"blocking":0,"warnings":0,"identical":0,"distinct":0,"runs":0},"lock":{"commit